    {
      "id": "compare-endpoints",
      "name": "CompareEndpoints",
      "category": "IPAddress",
      "signature": "CompareEndpoints(Target, In Addr)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FInternetAddr*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Addr",
          "type": "FInternetAddr&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Compares FInternetAddrs together, comparing the logical net addresses (endpoints)\nof the data stored, rather than doing a memory comparison like the equality operator does.\nIf it is not explicitly implemented, this falls back to just doing the same behavior of the\ncomparison operator.\n@Param InAddr The address to compare with.\n@return true if the endpoint stored in this FInternetAddr is the same as the input."
    },
